      "id": "claim_6e79e463949949a1bba56dd9527727b3",
      "statement": "Write approvals depend on `MCP_REQUEST_STATE_KEY`: when the key is absent the server keeps read surfaces available but the write surface reports an operator-configuration outage, and when a non-empty key is too short the app fails at boot because that is treated as misconfiguration rather than a supported mode.",
